*.ipin Vss
R1 net2 Vcm 10k
XM1 T1 net5 net7 Vcm sg13_hv_pmos w=50u l=10u ng=6 m=2 mm_ok=1
I0 Vdd net1 5u
x1 Vdd T1 Vss net2 net1 net2 opamp_rtr
I3 Vdd net3 5u
